      "text": "The left column is a live WebGL canvas \u2014 536 \u00d7 620 at x 164. The grey shapes inside it are footprint stand-ins, not a proposal for the models. Only the frame, its size and its position are designed here."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-daai",
      "x": 3440,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 700,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "The DAAI chapter's object is the fellowship's own award. It is the one model that is not a GLB \u2014 the trophy is generated procedurally from curves at runtime, so it costs no download. Every chapter has an object; the frame never sits empty and the layout never shifts."
    },
